        "body": "Resource-audit step based on stable d53d065.\n\n- add one shared 25-request live item-detail budget per CATALOG_SCAN\n- pass the same budget through MAIN and all additional products\n- preserve existing per-product local limits while preventing them from multiplying across products\n- exact current Vinted-model proof and cached identity do not consume the live-navigation budget\n- when the shared budget is exhausted, listings remain DISCOVERED for a later cycle instead of being misclassified\n- preserve CatalogWorkProcessor process-state cleanup introduced by #213\n- add unit coverage for budget exhaustion and shared consumption\n\nThe large NewNegotiationProcessor change is reused from the previously green #204 implementation rather than manually reconstructed. No normal worker-count/concurrency cap, negotiation quota, backend, frontend, or session behavior is changed.",
